WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:05.040
All right! The day's over!

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.110
Back to summer vacation!

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:12.070
Manaka, just so you know: there's no summer vacation from idol training.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.620
I oneninefour you that we must both get 194 jumps this month

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.160
to keep up with my calculations for making it to Debut class.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.830
One Nine Four... Jump?

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.480
All right! All right! All right! Yay!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.330
One Nine Four Jump, huh?

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.050
Amazing! Capisce!

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.990
Everyone's really doing their best-pri.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.030
Yeah! Watching others perform is fun too!

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.540
Okay, which one should we enter?

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.910
It's about time.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:25.460
Yeah!

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.580
I can't wait!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:30.120
That one seems super popular.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.590
Pri? Kuma, which one is that-pri?

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.550
That's the Sunshine Watermelon Live-kuma.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.600
Watermelon Live?

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.260
Why are there so many people there?

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.430
Houjou Sophie's supposed to be a guest there-kuma.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.580
They're all overreacting-kuma!

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.230
Sophie's performing there?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.400
Hey, Mireille! I wanna see Sophie's show!

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.040
I want you to see it too!

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.450
I've seen it loads of times-pri.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:02:59.950
But...

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.870
Let's go see it together!

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:03.870
I wanna see it with you!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.600
Huh...

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.770
<i>I guess that could work. Lala might even learn a thing or two...</i>

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:10.990
All right then-pri.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.590
Yay!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.490
You're the best, Sophie!

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:16.380
Sophie!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.880
Sophie! Look this way!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:23.090
Have you been good, my little cagebirds?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.560
Yes!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.520
I haven't been too good myself, though.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:31.980
So cool!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:33.470
Lady Sophie!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.360
You're the coolest-chanko!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.450
Wow... I've never actually seen her live before.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.570
Study her every motion carefully-pri!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.220
You want to hear my song?

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.330
Yeah we do!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.330
Well then, my dear little birds...

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.920
Solar Flare Sherbet.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:33.430
Cyalume Change!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.090
Amazing! Sophie's so amazing!

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:00.150
You're a true genius, Lady Sophie!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.110
I'm impressed!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:05.960
Amazing! Sophie's really cool!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:11.080
Pri... I don't know if she's a genius or what, but her shows always get me-pri.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.290
She deserves every bit of my admiration-pri.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.470
That was great.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.250
Yeah.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.460
So, about the 194 Jump plan.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.170
I can't get used to that change.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:28.640
We'll take part in this in September.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.450
Shining Future Idol Grand Prix?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:36.600
Yes. An audition commonly called a gateway to becoming a top idol.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.000
PriPara teams generally have 3 people.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.800
This is the same event where the legendary Saints first teamed up,

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:48.070
won the Grand Prix, and climbed to the top.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.350
I see!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:54.330
So we need to find another member...

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.750
Okay! I want to team up with Sophie!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.120
Huh? That's obviously impossible. Denied.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.460
What, why?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.100
Do you really need an explanation?

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.660
We're like apples and oranges.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.290
We're just peasants and she's the princess.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:13.570
Our idol ranks are completely different. She wouldn't even pay attention to us.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:17.270
What? We won't know if we don't ask!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.920
I heard someone say this on TV:

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:23.980
"Don't say <i>can't</i>! because you can! You can! You can! I know you can!"

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.760
Huh?

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:33.020
Lady Sophie, we still have time before today's show,

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:35.120
so how about a leisurely walk before it?

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:36.890
Why not?

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.580
Sophie!

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:42.290
I have a favor to ask of you, Sophie!

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.550
How dare you?!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:51.090
A nameless nobody like you has no right to get within three meters of Lady Sophie!

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.850
Oh, sorry.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:59.420
Hello, I'm Manaka Lala. Nice to meet you.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.050
I didn't mean it like that!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.520
Um, Sophie...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.910
I'm a big fan of your singing, Sophie.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.820
Would you please participate in this show with—

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.740
Stop! Didn't you hear you're a hundred million years too early to get any closer?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:19.500
The Commander of Lady Sophie's Royal Guard, Guardian Sadako, forbids you!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.460
Cardigan?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.760
Not cardigan! Guardian!

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.200
It means I'm a protector of Lady Sophie!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.170
Right...

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:33.650
And you need to have sent at least 100 fan letters to Lady Sophie before we'll accept any.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.780
100?! Amazing!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.270
Good luck with the next 99 then.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.760
Now then Lady Sophie, let's be on our way.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:41.230
Chanko.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.930
Un, but this isn't a fan letter!

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.940
What did I tell you?

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.630
Head Disciplinarian.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.900
Not only are our Idol Ranks way below hers,

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:56.960
Guardian Sadako, Commander of the Royal Guard, is famous for her steely defense.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:59.870
She won't let just anyone get close to her.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:03.840
You really are foolhardy, or childish.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.220
Do you get it now?

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.090
Yeah.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.420
I guess...

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.050
I need to try even harder!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.380
Here I go!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.510
You totally don't get it!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:19.920
Lovely little rose, would you like to follow me home?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.180
I'll grant you the privilege.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.440
Please take them!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.070
Though they pale next to your radiance.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.650
That's close enough!

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:34.530
I, Guardian Sadako, will receive them.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.830
Oh, there's Sophie!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.500
Get her, Chanko!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.790
Aye!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.460
Here I come!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.380
Do you finally get it?

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:55.620
Head Disciplinarian! You followed me here?

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.210
Of course not.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.060
I'm on my way to PriPara.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.800
Give up already.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:10.020
How do you do? Low temperature? Same here.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.980
So cool!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.200
Crocodile!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.420
Lady Sophie!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.540
Don't worry. Having crocodile fans isn't all that bad.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.320
Still cool!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.600
Wait, wait, wait...

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:28.580
This is exactly why our Lady Sophie needs us for protection.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.760
This is shameful! Pull yourself together!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:34.210
Croc!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.720
But I'm scared too!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.930
Like heck I am! It's just you again, isn't it?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.390
Teehee?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.350
I want Sophie to join—

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.310
Give up-chanko!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.950
Let's carry on, Lady Sophie.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.910
Manaka, you're an idiot, aren't you?

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.370
Croc...

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.830
Wise up already.

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:09.320
Yeah, but giving up right at the start is no good!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.790
Or that's what I heard on TV.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.380
I wanna keep trying!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.510
I can't really take a crocodile telling me that seriously.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:19.400
Croc...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.590
I've had enough.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:24.720
I don't even care anymore. Keep at it as long as you like.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.430
So you'll help me?

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:28.890
I have zero interest in playing along.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.900
Uh, okay...

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:35.790
Either way, Sophie lives at Proud Tower Hills next to the station.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.860
Everyone in our middle school knows that.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.570
Proud Tower Hills?

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.290
That's where the pickled plum pizza person lives too!

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.500
Thanks a lot, Head Disciplinarian Minami!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:04.600
Wow, Proud Tower Hills sure didn't get any less fancy.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.870
Hello?

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.560
Well, I'm here, but I guess I can't just go in on my own.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:12.720
Mister!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.600
Not here?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.740
Heya there, fishies!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.150
Living in a fancy place like this must be nice.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.250
They even have jellyfish!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:28.000
Woah! There's a big one!

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.460
Pshu...

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.190
So that's what they sound like!

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:34.040
Wait, isn't that the pickled plum pizza person?

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:37.250
U-Uh, are you out on a swim?

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:41.220
I fell in...

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:43.890
One more!

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.060
And capisce!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.270
Grab on!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.020
Gotcha!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.480
Thank pshu.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.990
A-Are you okay?

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.280
I wanna go back.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.930
You want to go back? To your apartment?

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:01.450
Yeah.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.910
Capisce!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:10.600
Hang on tight.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.950
What floor?

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:19.900
3... 3... 3...

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.470
Okay! Third floor it is!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.140
Oh! This is it.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.560
<i>Ehh...</i>

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.940
So? Is it one of these?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.060
Nope.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.030
They all look the same to me.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.150
Oh! Is this it?

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.280
Nope.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.200
Hmm? I guess 3 and 3 could make 9?

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:55.120
<i>It's just like the last floor...</i>

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.860
Oh! This is it.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:02.440
Aren't you just saying that because it looks the same?

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.720
Oh, this one. This one has to be it.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.390
Or not.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.880
It's not!

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.400
What? What now?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.780
Well, this is the top floor...

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.440
Here we go.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.280
Wh-What are you doing?

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.240
Hm?

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.280
No, no!

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:30.660
Sorry about that!

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.870
This is my little sister.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:36.290
Oh!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.770
<i>I remember her!</i>

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.340
I see. You're her big sister.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.220
I'm glad we ran into you. We were totally lost.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.800
Thank you.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.680
She's got no sense of direction at all, and even gets lost in here. It's quite a hassle.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:54.310
There!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.670
See you! Cosmic thanks! Mega cosmic thanks!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.690
Oh! Room 3333!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.660
Huh? What'd I even come here for?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.120
Hey! What are you doing?

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.120
The entries are closing again-kuma!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:17.300
Oh no! I'll be right there!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:18.910
Oh?

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.920
Pshu...

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.590
Sorry! I guess I overdid it with the bump.

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.000
Cosmic sorry, Sophie.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.080
PriPara Change Complete!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.690
Sorry I'm late!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.400
So how'd it go-pri? With Sophie?

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:49.600
I didn't see her, but I'll try again tomorrow!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:52.390
Hmm... You still haven't given up-pri.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:53.490
In other news.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:54.970
Did I mention before-pri?

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:58.750
We're starting our special dance practice for September tomorrow.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.320
I'll work on the Sophie matter after that then!

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:04.440
My calculations have left no room for that kind of leftover energy-pri.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:09.260
So who do you want to team up with?

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:14.600
Huh? I'll need some time to assess the situation and make more calculations...

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:18.430
You're falling out of character again-kuma. Idols are all about character-kuma!

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:22.050
Eep! I'm such a kidder, ain't I?

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:24.400
A pop, and a step, and gotcha!

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:31.440
Come to think of it, isn't the scout working with Sophie, Usagi, an old friend of yours, Kuma-pri?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.610
<i>Adieu, loser!</i>

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.510
Wow! You're his friend, Mr. Kuma?

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.080
Who you callin' a loser-kuma?

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.710
I'll draw all over his face with a marker one day!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:44.040
I'll treat him like dirt and laugh-kuma! Stop screwin' with me-kuma!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.790
One two three, boom!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:50.710
Get it-pri? Sophie would be a problematic choice on this end too-pri.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.690
We're basically destined to be apart-pri.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:57.760
Well, yeah, it seems obvious those two are on <i>really</i> bad terms.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.940
But if we formed a team with Sophie,

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.730
I'm sure Mr. Kuma could work out his differences with Mr. Usagi out too!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.940
Who'd want anything to do with that jerk-kuma?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.900
Save the sleep-talking for sleeping! Got me? Got me?

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:14.200
And seriously thinking you could team up with Houjou Sophie-kuma?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.130
No way would Usagi let that happen-kuma.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.410
And I'm against it, too-kuma.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:26.180
I'm telling you-kuma, just let me take care of things. For your own good-kuma.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.310
You understand-kuma? Hmm-kuma?

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.670
Mr. Kuma, you're weird.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:34.590
What are you getting so uppity for-pri? Did you even handle the entries for today-pri?

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.350
Ah! Right-kuma! A capable scout like me wouldn't mess something like that up-kuma!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:41.270
Give it your all today-kuma!

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:42.680
Okay!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.980
Pri!

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.240
Let's give it our all again-pri!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.150
Yeah.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.950
Coord Change Start!

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.460
The Flower Meringue Coord.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.960
It's Twinkle Ribbon's most popular coord right now.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.960
Flower Meringue!

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:15.470
Boosting that loveliness score with a matching set!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.900
Both of you are really making that one work.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.970
Flower Meringue-pri!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:26.230
Lala and Mireille. I'm expecting a lovely show from you!

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:27.140
<i>Lala's really going for it today.
She really wants to impress Sophie-pri!</i>

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.330
<i>I can't get left behind-pri!</i>

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.450
<i>I hope everyone's having fun-pri!</i>

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.460
Pri!

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.480
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.850
Twirly twirl!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:43.850
What's in it?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.730
Present For You!

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:57.270
Cyalume Change!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.080
Lala, you're the best!

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.940
You're so cute, Mireille!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.920
All right! We did great!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.910
You were in top form today, Lala!

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.270
Sophie's appearing today too, right?

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:47.120
I wonder if she was listening.

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:51.330
Nah, I heard some of her staff worried 'cause she's nowhere to be found today.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:56.290
I hope she runs late and Usagi gets in trouble-kuma!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.410
Pshu... What a shame...

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.040
What was that-pri?

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:04.510
I caught the catchphrase from the pickled plum pizza person.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:10.460
The stage awaits me.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.640
We've been expecting you, Lady Sophie!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:19.360
Thank you for your patience! Next on stage, our special guest: Houjou Sophie!

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:29.080
Have you been good, my little cagebirds?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.090
Yeah!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.790
I haven't been too good myself, though.

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:37.960
So cool!

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:42.920
Amazing! So amazing!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.770
Sophie!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.100
Mireille.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:58.770
I really do want to team up with Sophie...

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.700
I guess there's no stopping you.

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.510
I admit defeat-pri.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:10.910
I think you managed to flip the switch on my motivation, too.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.370
So?

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.590
Let's go ask Sophie together-pri!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.080
All right!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:21.570
But we must raise our Idol Rank before that.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:24.400
Yeah! 194 Jump, right? Let's do this!

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.050
Thanks! I love you, Mireille!

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:09.530
A new Making Drama? Capisce!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.420
Special training in the PriPara training room!

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:15.240
Objection! The training rooms are way too packed during summer-pri!

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:16.530
Then we can do it at my place!

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:19.460
Objection! The headmistress could come over, so we have to stay out-pri!

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.870
No practice, then?

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:24.520
Objection! How will we Rank Up without training-pri?

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:26.490
What's with the objections?

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:28.470
You'll see once you come to my place-pri!

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:32.860
Objection? Lala's Coming To My Place-pri!

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.860
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
